<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Buyers seek prompt shipment.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Buyers seek prompt shipment.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soymeal buyers favored product for prompt shipment, largely ignoring the higher priced August positions, soymeal dealers said.</p>
<p>August soymeal was priced $6 to $8 per ton more than July shipped soymeal. Tight soybean supplies and expected lower crush levels this month and next prompted the higher offering prices, they said.</p>
<p>Several crushing plants have scheduled downtime for maintenance later this month.</p>
<p>Soymeal basis values were mostly unchanged.</p>
